      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      558.48,
      562.18,
      592.55
    ],
    "text": "The notification relating to the Rates of Exchange published in Gazette No. 2004/01 of 30th January, 2017 is herebyrescinded and the said rates of exchange are scheduled to be rescinded by a similar notification to be published on or before12th February, 2017.",
